    t = t.replace("ex:Lineage4 backlog:openedWithProfile", "ex:Lineage4 rdfs:comment \"The rule set RS_DigestTable_v5 (obligation artifacts are not stage content; admitted items and urgent items do not move the Backlog digest) is adopted at the Mission step, while the lineage is still at LS_Opened and its Mission output is not yet closed (G89, G156, G157, G158); the opening profile does not carry it.\"@en .\nex:Lineage4 backlog:openedWithProfile", 1)
